    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d522">

                <pb facs="0737" n="631" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg631"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the French
                    Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-09"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received with pleasure your note of
                    the 1st instant announcing the election of Mr. Armand Fallières as President of
                    the French Republic, and I join most cordially in the wish you express for the
                    continued strengthening, under Mr. Fallière’s presidency, of the ties of
                    friendship and sympathy that bind our two countries.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
